---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'; // Importação obrigatória para otimização de imagens
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/Gemini_Generated_Image_lelaexlelaexlela.png'; // Reutilizando a imagem ou uma de sua escolha
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

import default_logo from '../../assets/default-logo.jpg'

const title = "Privacy Policy - Market Ripple News";
const description = "Read the Privacy Policy for Market Ripple News. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your data in compliance with financial content standards.";
const pubDate = new Date('June 27 2026');
const updatedDate = new Date('July 05 2026');
const TitleSize = "2.5rem";

const heroImageData = { 
  width: 1600, 
  height: 900, 
  src: '../assets/Gemini_Generated_Image_lelaexlelaexlela.png',
  alt: "Data security and privacy concept" 
};

const heroImage = AboutHeroImage;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={title} description={description} image={default_logo} />
		<style>
	main {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 960px; /* Melhor prática para responsividade */
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 1rem;
	}
	ul {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 1rem;
		list-style-type: disc;
		margin: 1rem 0 2rem 2rem;
		padding: 0;
	}
	ul li {
		width: 100%; /* Adaptação para formato de texto de política */
		color: rgb(var(--black));
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	
	ul li * {
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	ul li img {
		display: block; 
		width: 100%; 
		height: auto;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
	}

	.title {
		margin: 0;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
		line-height: 1.2;
	}
	.date {
		margin: 0;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	/* Responsivo Mobile */
	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		ul {
			gap: 0.5rem;
		}
	}
</style>
	</head>
<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<article>
				<div class="hero-image">
					{heroImageData && <Image width={heroImageData.width} height={heroImageData.height} src={heroImage} alt={heroImageData.alt} loading="eager" />}
				</div>
        <div class="title">
            <br>
						<h1 style={{ fontSize: TitleSize, fontWeight: '700' }}>{title}</h1>
						<p class="date">Last Updated: {updatedDate.toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>
						<hr /><br>
					</div>

					<p>At <strong>Market Ripple News</strong>, accessible from our main domain, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document contains types of information that is collected and recorded by Market Ripple News and how we use it.</p>

<p>If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us.</p>
<br>

<h2>1. Log Files and Analytical Data</h2>
<p>Market Ripple News follows a standard procedure of using log files. These files log visitors when they visit websites. All hosting companies do this as part of hosting services' analytics. The information collected by log files includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date and time stamp, referring/exit pages, and possibly the number of clicks. These are not linked to any information that is personally identifiable. The purpose of the information is for analyzing trends, administering the site, tracking users' movement on the website, and gathering demographic information to better understand our global and regional audiences (such as our core Web3 hubs).</p>
<br>

<h2>2. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
<p>Like any other website, Market Ripple News uses 'cookies'. These cookies are used to store information including visitors' preferences, and the pages on the website that the visitor accessed or visited. The information is used to optimize the users' experience by customizing our web page content based on visitors' browser type and/or other information.</p>
<br>

<h2>3. Google DoubleClick DART Cookie & Advertising Partners</h2>
<p>Google is one of the third-party vendors on our site. It also uses cookies, known as DART cookies, to serve ads to our site visitors based upon their visit to our platform and other sites on the internet. However, visitors may choose to decline the use of DART cookies by visiting the Google ad and content network Privacy Policy at the following URL – <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a></p>

<p>Some of the advertisers on our site may use cookies and web beacons. Our advertising partners include:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Google AdSense / Google Programmatic Ad Exchange</strong></li>
  <li><strong>Cryptocurrency Exchanges & Trading Platforms</strong> (via official referral and affiliate programs).</li>
  <li>Affiliate Network partners in the Crypto, Web3, and Macro-Finance niches.</li>
</ul>
<p>Third-party ad servers or ad networks use technologies like cookies, JavaScript, or Web Beacons that are used in their respective advertisements and links that appear on Market Ripple News, which are sent directly to users' browsers. They automatically receive your IP address when this occurs. These technologies are used to measure the effectiveness of their advertising campaigns and/or to personalize the advertising content that you see on websites that you visit.</p>
<p>Note that Market Ripple News has no access to or control over these cookies that are used by third-party advertisers.</p>
<br>
<h2>3.1. Affiliate & Referral Links Disclosure</h2>
<p>Market Ripple News participates in various affiliate marketing programs, which means we may get paid commissions on editorially chosen products or services purchased through our links to third-party websites (such as cryptocurrency exchanges, wallets, or financial tools). </p>
<p>This monetization method helps support our independent research and infrastructure. However, it never influences our analytical content, market breakdown, or information gain standards. You are under no obligation to click on these links or create accounts through our referral codes.</p>
<br>
<h2>4. Third Party Privacy Policies</h2>
<p>Market Ripple News's Privacy Policy does not apply to other advertisers or websites. Thus, we are advising you to consult the respective Privacy Policies of these third-party ad servers for more detailed information. It may include their practices and instructions about how to opt-out of certain options.</p>
<p>You can choose to disable cookies through your individual browser options. To know more detailed information about cookie management with specific web browsers, it can be found at the browsers' respective websites.</p>
<br>

<h2>5. CCPA & GDPR Data Protection Rights</h2>
<p>We want to make sure you are fully aware of all of your data protection rights. Every user is entitled to the following:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>The right to access</strong> – You have the right to request copies of your personal data.</li>
  <li><strong>The right to rectification</strong> – You have the right to request that we correct any information you believe is inaccurate.</li>
  <li><strong>The right to erasure</strong> – You have the right to request that we erase your personal data, under certain conditions.</li>
  <li><strong>The right to restrict processing</strong> – You have the right to request that we restrict the processing of your personal data, under certain conditions.</li>
</ul>
<br>

<h2>6. Children's Information</h2>
<p>Another part of our priority is adding protection for children while using the internet. We encourage parents and guardians to observe, participate in, and/or monitor and guide their online activity.</p>
<p>Market Ripple News does not knowingly collect any Personal Identifiable Information from children under the age of 13. If you think that your child provided this kind of information on our website, we strongly encourage you to contact us immediately and we will do our best efforts to promptly remove such information from our records.</p>

<hr style="margin-left: -1em" class='big-separator'>
<br><br>
<h3>Compliance & Administration</h3>
<h2>Vitor Domingos</h2> 
<h1>Founder & Tech Lead | Market Ripple News</h1>
<p>This policy ensures total clarity on user privacy, built on zero-bloat static architecture to safeguard open, secure, and compliant micro-interactions across our decentralized community framework.</p>

			</article>
		</main>
        <Footer />
</body>
</html>